The suite proves every named hazard:

| Test | Hazard exercised | Property asserted |
|------|------------------|-------------------|
| `TestBasicTransfersWithDuplicationAndReordering` | duplicated + reordered delivery | lower bound holds on every replica; all replicas converge |
| `TestReallocationRace` | spend racing with revoke; late spend on old grant | remainder re-issued exactly once; late spend fenced |
| `TestStaleRestart` | crash after ack, restart from pre-revocation snapshot | revoked grant is not spendable after replay |
| `TestPartialQuorumLoss` | 5 nodes split 2/3 | minority keeps transferring; control authority moves to majority; no overspend |
| `TestConservation` | many concurrent transfers | Σ accepted debits == Σ accepted credits |
| `TestRandomizedFuzz` | 300 randomized interleavings of alloc/spend/revoke/restart/gossip | `CheckInvariant` after **every** step + convergence at the end |

The fuzz loop checks the safety invariant after every event, which is what rules out transient lower-bound violations during a race.
